§ `The stack table and the caps-and-mechanics list`

-- Claims the waterfall does not print: the flat backup's overseas rate, and
-- the reset basis and date-attribution each card counts its cap by. Each is
-- asserted once, on a purchase the sheet routes to that card, rather than
-- repeated on every row.


§§ `Citi PremierMiles -- the rate the waterfall never prints`

-- [S5] stack table: "Citi PremierMiles | 1.2 / 2.2 | uncapped | Backup flat (demoted by PRVI)"
