§§ `UOB Lady's Solitaire -- posting date, two S$750 categories`

-- [S5] "Solitaire caps are per CATEGORY: S$750 Dining + S$750 Family = S$1,500 combined. Unused room in one category does NOT transfer to the other. Counts by POSTING date (a 30 Jun purchase posting 1 Jul lands in July's cap)."
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 dining out`)'s `cap`'s `attribution` EQUALS `By posting date`
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `cap`'s `attribution` EQUALS `By posting date`
-- The two categories carry S$750 each and neither carries S$1,500: a dining
-- purchase and a grocery purchase are asserted separately, which is the only
-- way this domain can express "no transfer between".
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 dining out`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 750
#ASSERT (`the rate on` `UOB Lady's Solitaire` `S5 the cardholder` `S5 the month` `S5 cold storage`)'s `cap`'s `bonus spend per month` EQUALS 750


§§ `Citi Rewards -- posting date`

